gating/calibration, instrumentation, and author-side ergonomics. All items are evidence-backed from the sidecar corpus and backtests recorded on 696a.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every child ticket below is closed with its change landed through Gerrit (checked: all children report status closed and their rebar-ticket commits are reachable from origin/main).\n- [ ] Plan-review coverage metrics report token totals including Pass-1 after the instrumentation child lands (checked: a fresh review-plan run's sidecar coverage.metrics carries input/output/cache token counts).\n- [ ] No gate weakening: the criteria enabled for blocking (T3, T10, T5c HIGH, G7 contradicts_reality) use the operator-approved thresholds, and all previously blocking criteria remain blocking (checked: criteria_routing.json diff review).\n\n## Decomposition\nBugs (gate-exempt, claimable immediately): BLOCK-verdict reuse; docs-reviewer surfacing; T1 web grounding.\nIndependent stories/tasks: DET-block short-circuit; clarity floor additions; edit/claim --review flags; Pass-1 usage instrumentation; optional genai-prices costing; DET triggers for zero-finding criteria; T11 portable constraint; coaching moves in the guide.\nChained by file overlap: pass1.py/passes.py chain = usage instrumentation -> warm-then-fan-out -> shared prefix + exhaustiveness -> mid-review cancellation. criteria_routing.json chain = DET triggers -> T3/T10 blocking -> T5c rewrite -> G7 blocking.\nOrdering rationale: instrumentation lands before the cache optimizations it measures; routing-file changes are serialized to avoid textual conflicts; rubric-only and docs-only changes are unordered.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["depends_on","28d5-c980-ba43-4c6e"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"17530769-9b51-4ff8-bf31-d898196e88a4","plan_revie